mn1 data are from Elisenda Costa
KodamaFiles are from Ken Kodama
MolinaFiles are from Roberto Molina
Calvin2026/ES16-4A.dat is from Calvín, P., et al. (2025), Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17789941 (CC BY 4.0), the data of Calvín et al. (2026), JGR Solid Earth, https://doi.org/10.1029/2025JB033544: a specimen with overturned bedding
Vernet2026/GTX080201A.dat is from Vernet Tarragó, E. (2026), Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20326424 (CC BY 4.0), the data of Vernet et al. (2026), Geologica Acta, https://doi.org/10.1344/geologicaacta2026.24.15: a decimal volume, and a specimen name that the file keeps to 8 characters
